      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-question" onclick="this.parentElement.classList.toggle('open')">
          How does Teamwork Commerce prevent overselling limited luxury collections?
          <span class="faq-icon"><i class="ti ti-plus"></i></span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer"><p>RFID-powered inventory provides 99.9% accuracy across every store and warehouse globally. Each unit is individually tracked by EPC. If only 3 units of an overcoat remain (one in Paris, one in London, one in Milan) the system knows exactly where they are and prevents any channel from selling a ghost unit. For small production runs where a canceled order means losing a high-value client, this precision is essential.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-question" onclick="this.parentElement.classList.toggle('open')">
          Can Teamwork replace our handwritten client books while staying GDPR compliant?
          <span class="faq-icon"><i class="ti ti-plus"></i></span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer"><p>Yes. The unified CRM stores sizes, style preferences, purchase history, wishlists, and associate notes across every store and channel, fully GDPR compliant with data protection built into the architecture. 121 Commerce AI uses this data to surface recommendations in real time. The client profile follows the customer whether they visit Paris, London, or Milan.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-question" onclick="this.parentElement.classList.toggle('open')">
          Does the POS fit the luxury in-store aesthetic?
          <span class="faq-icon"><i class="ti ti-plus"></i></span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer"><p>Teamwork Commerce is 100% native iOS. The interface is sleek, minimal, and designed for the luxury environment, no industrial hardware, no clunky terminals. Associates complete transactions on iPad or iPhone anywhere in the boutique, creating a personal shopping experience without interrupting the brand atmosphere.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-question" onclick="this.parentElement.classList.toggle('open')">
          How does this compare to other POS platforms for luxury retail?
          <span class="faq-icon"><i class="ti ti-plus"></i></span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer"><p>Teamwork Commerce is built for luxury's scarcity and clienteling requirements; the others are not. Shopify Plus excels at high-volume e-commerce but its in-store POS and inventory precision aren't built for the scarcity management luxury demands. NewStore focuses on mobile-first associate experience but lacks native RFID and the 99.9% inventory accuracy critical for limited runs. Teamwork Commerce combines the polished iOS interface, native RFID precision, 121 Commerce AI clienteling, consignment/deposit management, and global compliance across 40+ countries, in one platform.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-question" onclick="this.parentElement.classList.toggle('open')">
          Which luxury brands use Teamwork Commerce?
          <span class="faq-icon"><i class="ti ti-plus"></i></span>
